  "sandbox_stdout": "Parent available: length=320, sum=1.00\n=== Phase 1: Quick Exploration ===\n  Scan: n=256, parent, score=1.518559\n  Scan: n=256, parent_ds, score=1.507899\n  Scan: n=320, parent, score=1.507429\nPhase 1 done. Best so far: 1.507429\n=== Phase 2: Deep LP Optimization ===\n  Optimizing n=320, starting score=1.507429\n    LP iter 200: obj=1.507319, M=0.00235519, t=137.6s\n    LP iter 400: obj=1.507319, M=0.00237559, t=288.6s\n    LP iter 600: obj=1.507319, M=0.00238047, t=442.2s\n    LP iter 800: obj=1.507319, M=0.00237210, t=508.0s\n    LP iter 1000: obj=1.507319, M=0.00237210, t=566.0s\n    LP iter 1200: obj=1.507319, M=0.00241451, t=644.7s\n    LP iter 1400: obj=1.507319, M=0.00238364, t=748.0s\n    LP iter 1600: obj=1.507319, M=0.00238241, t=827.5s\n    LP iter 1800: obj=1.507319, M=0.00241620, t=896.8s\n    LP iter 2000: obj=1.507319, M=0.00238518, t=975.3s\n    LP iter 2200: obj=1.507319, M=0.00238160, t=1093.3s\n    LP iter 2400: obj=1.507319, M=0.00236780, t=1190.1s\n  Deep LP improved: score=1.507319\nPhase 2 done. Best so far: 1.507319\n=== Phase 3: Gradient Polish ===\n  Gradient polish: score=1.507319\n  Perturb LP [1]: score=1.507311\nPhase 3 done. Best so far: 1.507311\n=== Phase 4: Final Polish ===\n\nFINAL SCORE: 1.507311 (n=320)",
